 of typical animated objects are listed below. Many of these creatures serve as guardians, surprising unsuspecting adventurers when they suddenly attack. Others serve as idle distractions for the exceptionally rich, simple servants created to handle odd jobs, and the like.</p>","publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Pathfinder #216: The Acropolis Pyre"}},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"perception":{"details":"","mod":6,"senses":[{"type":"darkvision"}]},"resources":{},"saves":{"fortitude":{"saveDetail":"","value":10},"reflex":{"saveDetail":"","value":3},"will":{"saveDetail":"","value":4}},"skills":{"athletics":{"base":9}},"traits":{"rarity":"common","size":{"value":"med"},"value":["construct","mindless","spirit"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"npc","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.myth-speaker-bestiary.Actor.o2O3dPdWCCgRcIO3"},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors!Jb3zTEuzkBQ2xHl4","prototypeToken":{"texture":{"src":"modules/pf2e-dungeon-crawl/assets/creature-art/myth-speaker-bestiary/animated-panoply.webp"}},"flags":{"pf2e-dungeon-crawl":{"artEntryId":"myth_speaker_bestiary__animated_panoply","sourcePack":"pf2e.myth-speaker-bestiary","sourceDocId":"o2O3dPdWCCgRcIO3"}}}